**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.strapi
**/.tmp
**/dist
**/out

# Secrets must never enter the build context: the client/strapi Dockerfiles build from the
# monorepo root with `COPY . .`, so anything not excluded here is baked into an image layer.
# Per-app .dockerignore files do not apply — the context is the repo root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.local.example

# Not needed at build time; keeps the context small and avoids leaking history.
.git
